    {
      "id": "claim_69498a208ed54f6f92ad5dec6d60c2cf",
      "statement": "The web and native assistant-polyfill loaders are deliberately split at the platform boundary for bundle size: the unsuffixed assistant-polyfills.ts is the web variant and installs ONLY the refresh wrapper (the crypto/streaming globals are native on web), while assistant-polyfills.native.ts loads the polyfill libraries — whose static requires otherwise put text-encoding (535 KB) and web-streams-polyfill (61 KB) in the entry chunk for every web user even though they can never execute there.",
