        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e886d163b4e34de78742c0773b4ababa",
      "statement": "Verification of the refresh-retry chain is split by tier: the client-side orchestration over a real mid-session expiry rests on the Android harness, while the server half is proven by the web E2E tests/e2e/web/agent-session-refresh.spec.ts, which drops only the access cookie, observes the `no_token` 401 the agent route sees, and shows POST /bff-api/auth/refresh rotating the cookie so the retry succeeds.",
